IMPORTANT: This is a placeholder private key file.
For development: Generate a self-signed key using:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout ssl/indicab.key -out ssl/indicab.crt -days 365 -nodes

For production: Replace with Let's Encrypt private key from:
  /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/privkey.pem

SECURITY: Never commit actual private keys to git! Use .gitignore to exclude:
  ssl/
  .env
  .env.production

See SSL_SETUP_GUIDE.md for complete instructions.
